  "body": "Download the information from the link https://vltre.co/wgIayI\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned on the prestigious Kumukumu Road, this brand-new executive residence captures breathtaking, uninterrupted sea views right from the heart of Long Bay. Elevated and commanding, the home overlooks the sparkling coastline, Long Bay Village, and dazzling evening lights - a truly rare opportunity to secure luxury coastal living at its finest.\r\n\r\nBoasting approximately 348sqm of thoughtfully designed living space, this stunning home combines sophistication, flexibility, and comfort for modern family living.\r\n\r\nAs you step through the grand entrance foyer, you are immediately welcomed by an incredible sense of space, light, and panoramic sea views framed directly ahead. Every detail has been carefully crafted to maximise natural light, privacy, and the seamless connection between indoor luxury and outdoor beauty.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home features a designer kitchen fitted with premium Miele appliances, a gas-and-electric hybrid cooktop, and a practical scullery for effortless entertaining and everyday functionality.\r\n\r\nFlowing from the living area is a beautiful sea-facing balcony - the perfect setting to enjoy morning coffee, sunset drinks, or relaxed evenings with friends while overlooking the expansive ocean views.\r\n\r\nOn the main level, a versatile family room with its own private bathroom offers endless possibilities. Whether used as a media room, tea room, games lounge, guest suite, or work-from-home space, it adapts beautifully to your lifestyle needs.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, a convenient kitchenette creates added comfort and independence. The upper floor hosts three luxurious master suites, including an extraordinary primary suite with soaring high-stud ceilings and spectacular panoramic sea views. Wake up to the ocean every morning, and unwind in the freestanding bathtub perfectly positioned to face the sea - a truly romantic retreat unlike anything else.\r\n\r\nDownstairs offers a fully self-contained two-bedroom living area with its own lounge, ideal for extended family, teenagers, guests, or potential rental income. Step outside to the stylish outdoor louvre-covered entertaining area, thoughtfully designed as a refined and relaxing space for year-round outdoor living, dining, and social gatherings.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include:\r\n\r\nDouble internal-access garage plus off-street parking for two more vehicles\r\nMassive unobstructed sea views from multiple levels\r\nElevated position in the centre of Kumukumu Road\r\nHigh-end finishes and premium craftsmanship throughout\r\nExceptional indoor-outdoor flow\r\nMultiple living areas for large or multi-generational families\r\nOutdoor louvre-covered patio and beautifully designed leisure area\r\n\r\nLocated just moments from Long Bay Beach and Long Bay Regional Park, with excellent nearby amenities including supermarkets, cafes, restaurants, pharmacies, sports facilities, and scenic coastal walking tracks. Zoned for excellent local schools including Long Bay College, Long Bay School, and Northcross Intermediate.\r\n\r\nThis is more than just a home - it is a statement of lifestyle, luxury, and breathtaking coastal beauty.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing, conjunctions welcome!!!",
